     - Test in multi-strategy context (4-edge, super5-dyn)
     - Overlays are portfolio-composition dependent (L2 from previous)
     - Solo improvement means nothing if it degrades the combo

  5. TRADE-LEVEL ANALYSIS
     - For each exit type: histogram of exit reasons
     - What % of trades exit at each barrier?
     - Are the best trades (big winners) being cut too early?
     - Distribution of trade P&L: did we lose the long tail?

